---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Vishwadeep Balakrishnan — independent AI researcher, founder, and investor.">
  <main>
    <div class="about-wrap">

      <div class="page-hed fade-up fade-up-0">
        <span class="page-hed-label">About</span>
        <h1>First principles<br><em>or bust.</em></h1>
      </div>

      <p class="about-lede fade-up fade-up-1">
        I'm interested in the questions that sit at the intersection of artificial intelligence,
        capital allocation, and the long-term trajectory of civilisation. Not in the abstract —
        in the concrete and the operational. Who funds what? Who builds what? What survives contact
        with reality, and what doesn't?
      </p>

      <div class="about-section fade-up fade-up-2">
        <span class="about-section-label">Research &amp; Philanthropy</span>
        <p>
          I conduct independent AI research, focused on the structural questions that are hardest
          to work on inside a company with a product roadmap: alignment, oversight mechanisms,
          and the governance of increasingly capable systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also run a philanthropy organisation grounded in hits-based giving — the idea that
          philanthropic impact, like venture returns, is deeply skewed. Most interventions do little.
          A small number matter enormously. The goal is to find and fund those.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-section fade-up fade-up-3">
        <span class="about-section-label">Building</span>
        <p>
          I'm currently building <strong>[Startup]</strong> — more details soon.
          I'm also a venture builder at <strong>Drexel VCC</strong>, where I work with founders
          at the earliest and most uncertain stage of company formation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-section fade-up fade-up-4">
        <span class="about-section-label">Writing &amp; Investing</span>
        <p>
          I write about global macro and technology investing on
          <a href="https://siliconmacro.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Substack</a>.
          My focus is on structural themes — how interest rate regimes shape valuations,
          how dollar cycles affect emerging market technology, and where durable asymmetries live.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-section fade-up fade-up-5">
        <span class="about-section-label">Startup Consulting</span>
        <p>
          I work with a small number of startups on growth strategy, go-to-market, business model
          design, and financing. I bring both an operator's instinct and an investor's eye to
          every engagement.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you're working on something early and want a thought partner,
          <a href="https://calendly.com/vishwadeep" target="_blank" rel="noopener">book an intro call</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
